msgid "Minimum severity of the imported vulnerabilities"
msgstr "Minimum severity of the imported vulnerabilities"

msgid "Vulnerabilities below this severity are skipped before being saved, which keeps the database light on a large fleet. The severity given by SentinelOne is used, otherwise the CVSS score; a vulnerability without either is kept."
msgstr "Vulnerabilities below this severity are skipped before being saved, which keeps the database light on a large fleet. The severity given by SentinelOne is used, otherwise the CVSS score; a vulnerability without either is kept."

msgid "Raising the threshold deletes nothing: the vulnerabilities already imported below it stay listed until SentinelOne stops reporting them. Lowering it imports the others at the next reading."
msgstr "Raising the threshold deletes nothing: the vulnerabilities already imported below it stay listed until SentinelOne stops reporting them. Lowering it imports the others at the next reading."
